{
  "description": "stratagemCanTarget(stratagem, keywords): whether a unit with these lower-cased keywords (the combined unit's, as the resolver collects them) can be the stratagem's friendly target. A Warlord target needs a unit that could contain the Warlord: one with CHARACTER. A case with members calls stratagemCanTargetUnit(stratagem, members, trigger_subject, printed): each member's keywords; a target that selects a model needs one member that meets it alone, a unit target reads the members combined; a target bound to the triggering unit also meets the friendly trigger_subject's all_of/any_of/none_of; a required trigger keyword outside printed (when given) is gained in play and counts as held. Keywords compare by normalizeName. A case with expected_names also calls stratagemTargetNames(stratagem, members, trigger_subject, printed): for an array-form target_restrictions, each named friendly target mapped to whether the unit can be it (enemy targets omitted; {} for a single-object form).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "warlord target: a CHARACTER unit with the required keyword qualifies",
      "target_restrictions": {
        "count": "one",
        "side": "your-army",
        "selects": "model",
        "warlord": true,
        "required_keywords": [
          "Death Guard"
        ]
      },
      "keywords": [
        "death guard",
        "character",
        "infantry"
      ],
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "warlord target: a unit with no CHARACTER cannot contain the Warlord",
      "target_restrictions": {
        "count": "one",
        "side": "your-army",
        "selects": "model",
        "warlord": true,
        "required_keywords": [
          "Death Guard"
        ]
      },
      "keywords": [
        "death guard",
        "infantry"
      ],
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "warlord target: the keyword lists still apply to the Warlord's unit",
      "target_restrictions": {
        "count": "one",
        "side": "your-army",
        "selects": "model",
        "warlord": true,
        "required_keywords": [
          "Death Guard"
        ]
      },
      "keywords": [
        "heretic astartes",
        "character",
        "infantry"
      ],
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "warlord target with no keywords: any CHARACTER unit",
      "target_restrictions": {
        "count": "one",
        "side": "your-army",
        "selects": "unit",
        "warlord": true
      },
      "keywords": [
        "character"
      ],
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "several targets: the non-Warlord target admits a unit the Warlord target refuses",
      "target_restrictions": [
        {
          "name": "leader",
          "count": "one",
          "side": "your-army",
          "selects": "model",
          "warlord": true
        },
        {
          "name": "escort",
          "count": "one",
          "side": "your-army",
          "selects": "unit",
          "required_keywords": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keywords": [
        "infantry"
      ],
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "no Warlord requirement: a unit with no CHARACTER qualifies",
      "target_restrictions": {
        "count": "one",
        "side": "your-army",
        "selects": "unit",
        "required_keywords": [
          "Death Guard"
        ]
      },
      "keywords": [
        "death guard",
        "infantry"
      ],
      "expected": true
    },
    {
